“ These agents were designed to achieve four objectives:[21][22]
to be undetectable using standard 1970s and 1980s NATO chemical detection equipment;
to defeat NATO chemical protective gear;
to be safer to handle; and
to circumvent the Chemical Weapons Convention list of controlled precursors, classes of chemical and physical form.[23]”
